Package: peperspray
Version: 0.1.3
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: peperspray maintainers
Depends: systemd, logrotate
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Description: Linux credential access guard for developer workstations
 peperspray is a Linux-first credential access guard. The package installs the
 peperspray CLI, the pepersprayd daemon, a systemd unit, and a starter policy
 config for protected developer credential files.
